# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Result metadata {#result-metadata}"
msgstr "Metadata keputusan {#result-metadata}"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In addition to the execution results, both the `PrimitiveResult` and `SamplerPubResult` objects contain a metadata attribute about the job that was submitted. The metadata containing information for all submitted PUBs (such as the various [runtime options](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options) available) can be found in the `PrimitiveResult.metatada`, while the metadata specific to each PUB is found in `SamplerPubResult.metadata`.\n"
msgstr "Selain keputusan pelaksanaan, kedua-dua objek `PrimitiveResult` dan `SamplerPubResult` mengandungi atribut metadata tentang kerja yang diserahkan. Metadata yang mengandungi maklumat untuk semua PUB yang diserahkan (seperti pelbagai [pilihan runtime](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/options) yang tersedia) boleh didapati dalam `PrimitiveResult.metatada`, manakala metadata yang khusus untuk setiap PUB terdapat dalam `SamplerPubResult.metadata`.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The client-side Sampler submits its workload as an [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output) job. The metadata of the underlying Executor result, which includes execution timing information called [_execution spans_](#execution-spans), is available under the `\"executor\"` key of `PrimitiveResult.metadata`.\n"
msgstr "Sampler sisi klien menghantar beban kerjanya sebagai job [Executor](/guides/executor-input-output). Metadata hasil Executor yang mendasari, yang merangkumi maklumat masa pelaksanaan yang dipanggil [_span pelaksanaan_](#execution-spans), tersedia di bawah kunci `\"executor\"` bagi `PrimitiveResult.metadata`.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"In the metadata field, primitive implementations can return any information about execution that is relevant to them, and there are no key-value pairs that are guaranteed by the base primitive. Thus, the returned metadata might be different in different primitive implementations.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"Dalam medan metadata, pelaksanaan primitif boleh mengembalikan sebarang maklumat yang berkaitan dengan pelaksanaan yang relevan bagi mereka, dan tiada pasangan kunci-nilai yang dijamin oleh primitif asas. Oleh itu, metadata yang dikembalikan dalam pelaksanaan primitif yang berbeza mungkin berbeza.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

