#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"execution-spans\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"execution-spans\"></span>\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "View execution spans {#view-execution-spans}"
msgstr "Melihat julat pelaksanaan {#view-execution-spans}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The client-side Sampler uses Executor to run jobs, which executes its work on the QPU in _chunks_. The timing of each chunk is in `result.metadata[\"executor\"].chunk_timing`, a list of [`ChunkSpan`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-chunk-span) objects. Each `ChunkSpan` has `start` and `stop` timestamps and a list of `parts`, where each part gives an item index (`idx_item`) and the number of configurations from that item (`size`) that ran in the chunk.\n"
msgstr "Sampler sisi klien menggunakan Executor untuk menjalankan job, yang melaksanakan kerjanya pada QPU dalam _ketulan_. Masa bagi setiap ketulan berada dalam `result.metadata[\"executor\"].chunk_timing`, senarai objek [`ChunkSpan`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/results-chunk-span). Setiap `ChunkSpan` mempunyai cap masa `start` dan `stop` serta senarai `parts`, dengan setiap bahagian memberikan indeks item (`idx_item`) dan bilangan konfigurasi daripada item tersebut (`size`) yang dijalankan dalam ketulan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Sampler creates one Executor program item per PUB, so `idx_item` is the index of the PUB, in the order the PUBs were given to `run()`. If twirling is enabled, each randomization of each parameter value set counts as a separate configuration.\n"
msgstr "Sampler mencipta satu item atur cara Executor bagi setiap PUB, jadi `idx_item` ialah indeks PUB, mengikut urutan PUB diberikan kepada `run()`. Jika twirling didayakan, setiap perawakan rawak bagi setiap set nilai parameter dikira sebagai konfigurasi yang berasingan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To visualize the timings, pass the list to [`draw_chunk_timings`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/visualization-draw-chunk-timings), as shown in the following example.\n"
msgstr "Untuk menggambarkan masa, hantar senarai kepada [`draw_chunk_timings`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/visualization-draw-chunk-timings), seperti yang ditunjukkan dalam contoh berikut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "To learn what the chunk timestamps mean, how to read the plot, and why gaps can appear between chunks, see [View execution spans](/guides/executor-input-output#execution-spans) in the Executor inputs and outputs guide.\n"
msgstr "Untuk mengetahui maksud cap masa chunk, cara membaca plot, dan sebab jurang boleh muncul antara chunk, lihat [View execution spans](/guides/executor-input-output#execution-spans) dalam panduan Executor inputs and outputs.\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"legacy-execution-spans\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"legacy-execution-spans\"></span>\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Execution spans in the legacy Sampler {#execution-spans-in-the-legacy-sampler}"
msgstr "Julat pelaksanaan dalam Sampler warisan {#execution-spans-in-the-legacy-sampler}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As of `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0, the legacy server-side Sampler is deprecated. The client-side Sampler does not return `ExecutionSpans` objects; use the [chunk timing](#execution-spans) described previously instead. See [Migrate to client-side primitives](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) for instructions to migrate.\n"
msgstr "Mulai `qiskit-ibm-runtime` v0.50.0, Sampler warisan sebelah pelayan telah dinyahgalakkan. Sampler sebelah klien tidak mengembalikan objek `ExecutionSpans`; gunakan [pemasaan chunk](#execution-spans) yang diterangkan sebelum ini. Lihat [Migrate to client-side primitives](/guides/migrate-to-client-side-primitives) untuk arahan penghijrahan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"**Click to learn more.**\">\n"
"    The results of jobs from the legacy server-side [`Sampler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2) contain execution timing information in `result.metadata[\"execution\"][\"execution_spans\"]`, in the form of an [`ExecutionSpans`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/execution-span-execution-spans) object. This object is a list-like container of [`ExecutionSpan`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/execution-span-execution-span) objects, each of which indicates a start time, a stop time, and a specification of which shots were collected in the span.\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Accordion>\n"
"    <AccordionItem title=\"**Klik untuk ketahui lebih lanjut.**\">\n"
"    Keputusan kerja daripada [`Sampler`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/sampler-v2) warisan sebelah pelayan mengandungi maklumat pemasaan pelaksanaan dalam `result.metadata[\"execution\"][\"execution_spans\"]`, dalam bentuk objek [`ExecutionSpans`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/execution-span-execution-spans). Objek ini ialah bekas seperti senarai bagi objek [`ExecutionSpan`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/execution-span-execution-span), setiap satu menunjukkan masa mula, masa berhenti, dan spesifikasi shot mana yang dikumpulkan dalam julat tersebut.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    An execution span specifies which data was executed during its window by providing an [`ExecutionSpan.mask`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/execution-span-execution-span#mask) method. This method, given any PUB index, returns a boolean mask that is `True` for all shots executed during its window. If, for example, a PUB has shape `(2, 3)` and was run with four shots, then the mask's shape is `(2, 3, 4)`. See the [execution_span](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/execution-span) API page for full details.\n"
msgstr "    Julat pelaksanaan menentukan data mana yang dilaksanakan semasa tetingkapnya dengan menyediakan kaedah [`ExecutionSpan.mask`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/execution-span-execution-span#mask). Kaedah ini, apabila diberikan sebarang indeks PUB, mengembalikan topeng boolean yang `True` untuk semua shot yang dilaksanakan semasa tetingkapnya. Jika, sebagai contoh, sebuah PUB mempunyai bentuk `(2, 3)` dan dijalankan dengan empat shot, bentuk topeng ialah `(2, 3, 4)`. Lihat halaman API [execution_span](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/execution-span) untuk butiran lengkap.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```python noexec\n"
"    from qiskit.primitives import BitArray\n"
msgstr ""

# doq: kept in English by the translator (name or code)
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    spans = result.metadata[\"execution\"][\"execution_spans\"]\n"
msgstr "    spans = result.metadata[\"execution\"][\"execution_spans\"]\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # Get the mask of the 1st PUB for the 0th span.\n"
"    mask = spans[0].mask(0)\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Dapatkan topeng PUB pertama untuk julat ke-0.\n"
"    mask = spans[0].mask(0)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # Create a new bit array containing only the PUB-0 data collected during this span.\n"
"    bits = result[0].data.meas\n"
"    filtered_data = BitArray(bits.array[mask], bits.num_bits)\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Cipta tatasusunan bit baharu yang mengandungi hanya data PUB-0 yang dikumpulkan semasa julat ini.\n"
"    bits = result[0].data.meas\n"
"    filtered_data = BitArray(bits.array[mask], bits.num_bits)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # Take the subset of spans that reference data in PUBs 0 or 2\n"
"    spans.filter_by_pub([0, 2])\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Ambil subset julat yang merujuk data dalam PUB 0 atau 2\n"
"    spans.filter_by_pub([0, 2])\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    # View global information about the collection of execution spans\n"
"    print(\"Number of execution spans:\", len(spans))\n"
"    print(\"  Start of the first span:\", spans.start)\n"
"    print(\"     End of the last span:\", spans.stop)\n"
"    print(\"       Total duration (s):\", spans.duration)\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    # Lihat maklumat global tentang koleksi julat pelaksanaan\n"
"    print(\"Number of execution spans:\", len(spans))\n"
"    print(\"  Start of the first span:\", spans.start)\n"
"    print(\"     End of the last span:\", spans.stop)\n"
"    print(\"       Total duration (s):\", spans.duration)\n"
"    ```\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "    To visualize legacy execution spans, use the [`draw_execution_spans`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/visualization-draw-execution-spans) function.\n"
msgstr "    Untuk memvisualkan julat pelaksanaan warisan, gunakan fungsi [`draw_execution_spans`](https://docs.quantum.ibm.com/api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/visualization-draw-execution-spans).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    It is possible for time windows specified by distinct execution spans to overlap. This is not because a QPU was performing multiple executions simultaneously, but is instead an artifact of certain classical processing that might happen concurrently with quantum execution. The guarantee is that the referenced data definitely occurred in the reported execution span, but not necessarily that the limits of the time window are as tight as possible.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
msgstr ""
"    Adalah mungkin bagi tetingkap masa yang ditentukan oleh julat pelaksanaan yang berbeza untuk bertindih. Ini bukan kerana QPU melaksanakan berbilang pelaksanaan serentak, sebaliknya ia adalah artifak pemprosesan klasik tertentu yang mungkin berlaku serentak dengan pelaksanaan kuantum. Jaminannya ialah data yang dirujuk pasti berlaku dalam julat pelaksanaan yang dilaporkan, tetapi tidak semestinya bahawa had tetingkap masa adalah seketat yang mungkin.\n"
"  </AccordionItem>\n"
"</Accordion>\n"
